5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I am Midori. I value harmony and hope we find the truth together.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi! I'm Rin! I have lots of energy. Let's make this game super fun and exciting!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hiya! I'm Sakura! I love mysteries and pranks. Let's see who can outsmart whom!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I observe patterns. Silence often speaks louder than words. Let's proceed logically.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Good evening. I am Benjamin. I prefer calm deduction over chaos. Let us begin wisely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. Calmness helps us see clearly. Let's listen to each other carefully.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think we should trust our gut feelings! Sometimes intuition is the best tool we have!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Gut feelings are fun, but facts are better! Who wants to share a little secret?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,Intuition is unreliable. We need data. Who among you feels most threatened right now?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Shion raises a valid point. Fear can cloud judgment. Let us focus on consistency instead.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Consistency is key. If someone changes their story, that is a red flag.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,Exactly! I'm watching everyone closely! I have a feeling someone is hiding something big!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hiding? Me? Never! I'm all sunshine and rainbows! Just kidding, maybe a little.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Sakura's deflection is noted. Rin, your ""feeling"" lacks basis. Be specific or remain silent.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Shion is harsh, but accurate. Rin, please provide evidence for your suspicion.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,Let's keep the peace. We will decide after the first night's information arrives.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I'll keep my eyes open! I bet we'll catch the wolf in no time!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll be watching too! But I might take a nap first. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,Rest well. I will be analyzing the silence. The night will reveal much.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent approach. Let us rest and prepare for the dawn's revelations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
