31,1,1,talk,Midori,,I have information from last night. I will share it carefully to maintain trust.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,Ooh! Information! I'm so excited! Tell us everything! I have a hunch it's important!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, shiny info! I hope it's not about me! I'm just a cute little girl!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Midori, proceed. Precision is required. Vague statements only breed suspicion.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Midori, please state your findings clearly. Logic demands clarity, not emotion.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I checked Shion. Shion is human. This is a fact, not a feeling.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Shion is human? Wow! I thought he was acting weird! But okay, I'll trust you!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Shion is safe? That's great! I like Shion! He's smart and quiet!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Acknowledged. My silence was not deception, but calculation. Thank you for the verification.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,This eliminates one variable. We now have four suspects. Let us analyze their reactions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Rin, your excitement is noted. Sakura, your defense of Shion is interesting.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm just happy we're making progress! I think Benjamin is being too serious!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I just like Shion! He's cool! Why are you all looking at me like that?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Benjamin's seriousness is appropriate. Rin, your dismissal of logic is concerning.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Rin, I am not dismissing you. I am asking for substance. Shion, your reaction is calm.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let's vote for the person who seems least trustworthy. I feel Benjamin is very logical.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Wait, vote for Benjamin? He's just being careful! I think Sakura is acting too cute!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Me? I'm just being friendly! I don't know what to do! I'm so confused!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Midori, your suggestion is weak. Rin, your accusation of Sakura is baseless.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Midori, I appreciate the vote, but I believe in due process. Let us vote wisely.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
